      "summary": "Defines the multi-key authentication object model and lifecycle in OpenClaw, covering auth profiles, selection order priority, session overrides, and runtime state tracking. Explains key isolation across environments, zero-downtime key rotation workflows, emergency credential leak response, and audit verification probes.",
