      "filePath": "11_reliability_security/11.2_rotation_cooldown.md",
      "summary": "Details the auth profile cooldown and temporary disablement mechanisms designed to prevent retry amplification during provider outages or rate limits. Explains failure count cooldown tiers, exponential backoff for billing failures, and runtime state tracking via auth-state.json.",
      "tags": [
        "cooldown",
        "rate-limiting",
        "backoff",
        "fault-tolerance",
        "documentation"
      ],
      "complexity": "moderate"
