      "filePath": "11_reliability_security/11.3_fallback_rules.md",
      "summary": "Establishes explainable model fallback chains and failure triage rules to ensure continuous operation without silent model switches. Covers sequential fallback tiers, context overflow bypass behaviors, half-open probing during cooldown, and fault injection verification techniques.",
      "tags": [
        "model-fallback",
        "failover",
        "error-triage",
        "high-availability",
        "documentation"
